WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.760
The Qin dynasty had fallen, and the land was in chaos. Among the many powers, Liu Bang and Xiang Yu emerged as the two strongest forces.

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:15.400
Liu Bang entered Guanzhong first, which made Xiang Yu furious — he felt his own glory had been stolen.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.720
Xiang Yu laid a banquet at Hongmen and invited Liu Bang to attend.

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:25.360
Beside him, the old strategist Fan Zeng quietly plotted to seize the chance to eliminate Liu Bang.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.960
The mood at the banquet was extremely tense.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:35.000
Then Xiang Zhuang rose to perform a sword dance, his blade pointing again and again at Liu Bang — an assassination in disguise.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.080
At the critical moment, Fan Kuai burst in with his shield, stood before Liu Bang, and glared defiantly to protect his lord.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:54.280
In the end, Liu Bang slipped away under cover of a trip to the latrine, guarded by Fan Kuai and the others, and escaped disaster.
